---
description: Optional knowledge graph. Use only when the user asks how two symbols connect.
alwaysApply: false
---

`graphify-out/` exists. If the user asks for a graph, run `graphify path "A" "B"` or `graphify explain "X"` with `--budget 800`. Do not run a wide `graphify query`. Do not paste `GRAPH_REPORT.md` or `graph.json` into the chat.
